'snapshot:Read the authoritative window, tab, pane, and task-state projection' \
'agents:List only panes Nebula recognizes as AI agents, with semantic state and session identity' \
'agent-start:Start a verified AI CLI in a new terminal tab and assign a stable name' \
'agent-fork:Create an isolated Git worktree, then start a named AI CLI in that checkout' \
'agent-get:Resolve one managed agent by stable id or active name' \
'agent-prompt:Send one plain-text prompt to a managed agent' \
'agent-read:Read the terminal-buffer tail owned by a managed agent' \
'agent-wait:Wait for the same managed-agent generation to reach a semantic state' \
'subscribe:Stream state snapshots whenever their semantic content changes' \
'new-window:Create and focus a new terminal window' \
'focus:Focus a window or one of its panes' \
'new-tab:Create a default-shell tab in the target window' \
'split:Split the focused pane in the target window' \
'prompt:Send one plain-text prompt to a pane, optionally submitting it with Enter' \
'read:Read the latest logical lines from a pane'\''s real terminal buffer' \
